[depot])\n\n    # Route-elongation view: extra cost of inserting the candidate on the\n    # current arc (depot -> ... -> current -> cand) rather than closing the\n    # tour directly back to the depot.\n    detour = d_cur + d_dep - d_cur_dep\n\n    # Regret / future-accessibility: customers far from the depot would be\n    # expensive to serve on a later route; give them mild priority now.\n    mean_dep = float(np.mean(d_dep)) if len(d_dep) > 0 else 1.0\n    if mean_dep <= 0:\n        mean_dep = 1.0\n    far_pull = d_dep / mean_dep\n\n    # Load packing: favour larger demands while capacity remains, so routes\n    # fill rather than leaving fragments for extra trips.\n    dem = demands[unvisited_nodes].astype(float)\n    cap = float(rest_capacity) + 1e-9\n    load_frac = dem / cap\n\n    # Normalise detour by its own mean so the score is scale-free.\n    mean_det = float(np.mean(detour)) if len(detour) > 0 else 1.0\n    if mean_det <= 0:\n        mean_det = 1.0\n    elong = detour / mean_det\n\n    score = elong - 0.30 * far_pull - 0.40 * load_frac\n    return int(unvisited_nodes[np.argmin(score)])","code_sha256":"2a613cc08b81be440f2cd7ede39e57aa22bae73656af7cf9c69a6605f87de5ce","elapsed_seconds":0.235,"error_code":null,"error_detail":null,"evaluation_id":"f8e8d3d9829f4473baa00b47a269a44b","generation_parents":[{"algorithm":"Explicit parent","code_sha256":"9412548cd88a85f20e64b1e692807952558acc225b95c0923b504c0c3a2c6005","population_member_indices":[1],"selected_parent_position":0},{"algorithm":"This heuristic scores each unvisited customer using a scale-free angular sweep rule: it ranks candidates by the cosine of the angle formed at the current node between the depot direction and the candidate direction, preferring customers that continue smoothly in the current travel direction while penalizing sharp turns back toward the depot, combined with a capacity-aware term that favors high-demand customers early in the route so the route packs well before returning.","c